    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d102-a3">

                <pb facs="0217" n="147" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg147"/>

                <head>Commander Kirkland to Mr.
                        Asboth</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Steamer Wasp,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Off Buenos Ayres,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-03-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 9, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge as just
                    received your communication of yesterday requesting to know whether my special
                    instructions from the admiral contain anything conflicting with your intention
                    of holding a personal conference with Mr. Washburn, and I have the honor to
                    inform you that my instructions only require me to carry despatches.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. A. KIRKLAND, <hi rendition="#italic">Lieut. Commander U. S. N.,
                            Commanding U. S. Steamer Wasp.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Major General A. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Asboth,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">U. S. Minister to Argentine Confederation.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
